+| U1 | Source/frame/epoch/query-indexed observation capability, following `cram-core/phase_lock.rs`, `cram_anchor.rs` and refresh source authority | Existing source semantics and current owner rule: K on demand | Same-source positive test; wrong source, frame, epoch and equal-plaintext/different-phase refusals; no persistent K payload |
